            "en": "1. Hold the minus button (−) on the thermostat for 8 seconds.\n2. Let go when the Zigbee icon flashes on the display.\n3. Wait here while Homey finds the thermostat.\n\nWas it set up with another hub before? Reset it first: hold + and − for 5 seconds, press ⋯ until setting 13, choose == and wait 5 seconds.",
